    "body": "Previously, parsing and recreating a Python `requirements.txt` file only handled\r\nthe simple case of all dependencies being fully specified. This commit:\r\n- Parses Python requirement files in the general case\r\n- Adjusts the Python file update strategy to only alter a single line in the\r\n  dependency file when regenerating it\r\n- Ensures any comments and version specificity is preserved when a line in\r\n  `requirements.txt` is updated",
